{"t": 1.869, "s": "\u001b[1mMerion: an agent proposes a change. A person decides.\u001b[0m\n"}
{"t": 3.076, "s": "\u001b[2mreal Merion runtime \u00b7 FluxVM is a test stub (no VM)\u001b[0m\n"}
{"t": 4.285, "s": "\n"}
{"t": 4.285, "s": "\u001b[33magent wants to run:\u001b[0m echo hello > /tmp/specdir/a.txt\n"}
{"t": 5.489, "s": "\u001b[36m$ curl -X POST $MERION/v1/sessions/$SID/speculate -d '{command, paths:[\"/tmp\"]}'\u001b[0m\n"}
{"t": 6.494, "s": "  approval   \u001b[1mpending\u001b[0m  kind=changeset\n"}
{"t": 7.74, "s": "  would add  \u001b[32m[\"/tmp/specdir/a.txt\"]\u001b[0m\n"}
{"t": 8.988, "s": "  egress     blocked\n"}
{"t": 10.196, "s": "\n"}
{"t": 10.231, "s": "\u001b[1mNothing has been applied.\u001b[0m  FluxVM saw: speculate\n"}
{"t": 11.439, "s": "\n"}
